<title>USA: Triarc to buy Cable Car Beverage.</title>
<headline>Triarc to buy Cable Car Beverage.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh off its acquisition of Snapple, Triarc Cos Inc returned to the acquisition arena, announcing on Tuesday a deal to acquire soft drink marketer Cable Car Beverage Corp.</p>
<p>Triarc will issue about 1.5 million shares to acquire Cable Car, which will continue to operate under its existing management, the companies said in a joint statement. Based on Triarc's closing share price of 20-3/4 on Monday, the deal carries a price tage of about $31.1 million.</p>
</text>
